    "value": 407,
    "unit": "N",
    "hint": "肱二头肌的力已知，所以平衡的第一条件就够了：肌肉向上的拉力减去肘处向下的推力，必须剩下所承受的重力。",
    "solution": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\kFB &= 470\\ \\text{N};\\quad \\krone = 4.00\\ \\text{cm};\\quad \\kwarm = 2.50\\ \\text{kg};\\quad \\krtwo = 16.0\\ \\text{cm};\\quad \\kwbook = 4.00\\ \\text{kg};\\quad \\krthree = 38.0\\ \\text{cm}\\\\ \\kFE &= \\kwarm\\left(\\frac{\\krtwo}{\\krone} - 1\\right) + \\kwbook\\left(\\frac{\\krthree}{\\krone} - 1\\right)\\\\ &= (2.50\\ \\text{kg})(9.80\\ \\text{m/s}^2)\\left(\\frac{16.0\\ \\text{cm}}{4.00\\ \\text{cm}} - 1\\right)\\\\ &\\quad + (4.00\\ \\text{kg})(9.80\\ \\text{m/s}^2)\\left(\\frac{38.0\\ \\text{cm}}{4.00\\ \\text{cm}} - 1\\right)\\\\ &= 407\\ \\text{N}\\end{aligned}$$"
   }
